
  <sn><md>### **PAN**

:::.row
:::.col-12 .col-lg-6
Personal Area Network
- **Range:** ~1–10 meters
- **Purpose:** Connects personal devices around one person
- **Examples:** Bluetooth earbuds, smartwatch to phone, wireless keyboard/mouse
- **Owner:** Single person
:::

:::.col-12 .col-lg-6
![img](https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Nh-em0n/QDoc/main/BCS/Computer%20and%20ICT/B.Computer%20Networks/assets/pan_diagram.jpeg)
:::
:::
</md></sn>
